{"2955070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Love Letter", "steam_appid": 2955070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Move the love letter, collect the sweet words scattered around the classroom, and send your feelings to that girl! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an action game where you operate a love letter and collect items in the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls the love letter. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love letters can be captured by hitting the object displayed in the speech bubble in the field.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the perfect love letter for your heroine from the words in the field</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955070/extras/92d65879ad85887fb89ac4a7dcb2f991.avif?t=1733113670\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955070/extras_big/92d65879ad85887fb89ac4a7dcb2f991.avif?t=1733113670 width=800 height=450 /></span>Words will be added to the love letter when you hit the object displayed in the speech bubble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique love letter wording</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various endings depending on the love letter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a high school student is an emotional time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write a love letter appropriate for each girl who has her own troubles and convey your feelings to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it goes well, I'm happy, and if it doesn't, it might be interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you end up is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the nostalgic atmosphere and surreal laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Others :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow game distribution. Please Stream it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second heroine does not have a voice..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update: 2024/11</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>The third heroine has been added!</u></i></strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shindo Kotoha 3D Model Update</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player health has been abolished.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have moved the text count UI for love letters from the top-right to the top-left.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Move the love letter, collect the sweet words scattered around the classroom, and send your feelings to that girl! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an action game where you operate a love letter and collect items in the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls the love letter. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love letters can be captured by hitting the object displayed in the speech bubble in the field.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the perfect love letter for your heroine from the words in the field</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/